      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَتَهِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>Of,</i> or <i>relating to, the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْت</span>; and in the
same sense, if you will, you may say ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتِىٌّ</span></b> ;
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَتِهٌ</span></b>  also, with kesr to the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ت</span>, like as they
said <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرِحٌ</span>. (S.)

